{"unit_id": "tag:0H3I:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由定义立即可知，若概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>的每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都只有有限个不可约分支（irreducible components），则有\n<MATHSEG_0001>正规（normal）<MATHSEG_0002>弱（weakly）正规（normal）<MATHSEG_0003>半正规（seminormal）<MATHSEG_0004>\n弱正规性（weak normality）在仿射（affine）情形下的含义可以如下具体说明。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "weakly", "target_term": "弱"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "seminormal", "target_term": "半正规"}, {"source_term": "weak normality", "target_term": "弱正规性"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该段所讨论的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "有限性条件所涉及的开集。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "拟紧开集中要求只有有限个的分支。"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "蕴含链中的第一个性质。"}, {"source_term": "weakly", "target_term": "弱", "context": "修饰紧随其后的正规，二者共同表达 weakly normal。"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "在 weakly normal 中受 weakly 修饰，二者共同构成蕴含链中的第二个性质。"}, {"source_term": "seminormal", "target_term": "半正规", "context": "蕴含链中的第三个性质。"}, {"source_term": "weak normality", "target_term": "弱正规性", "context": "下一步将在仿射情形下具体说明的性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "具体说明弱正规性的情形。"}], "notes": []}
